---
import Layout from '../layouts/ArticlesPost.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Careers at Imaging Uganda/Africa"
  description="Explore ways to contribute to Imaging Uganda/Africa and connect with our team about opportunities."
  pubDate={new Date()}
>
  <p>
    Imaging Uganda/Africa supports medical imaging education and collaboration
    across the region. We welcome people who share that mission and want to help
    make reliable imaging knowledge more accessible.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Get involved</h2>
    <p>
      We are interested in hearing from medical imaging professionals, educators,
      writers, and community contributors who would like to support our work.
      Opportunities may include contributing educational content, sharing
      expertise, or collaborating on community initiatives.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Current opportunities</h2>
    <p>
      There are no specific vacancies listed at this time. If you would like to
      be considered for future opportunities or propose a contribution, email us
      with a short introduction, your area of interest, and relevant experience.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:alexmradiology@gmail.com?subject=Careers%20and%20contributions">
        Contact us about careers and contributions
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
